
 Trade the height of a steady Bolinger Band. Bolinger Bandwidth is our profit margin.

 Pre-conditions:
 ================
 1) Support Resistance should not contradict BB

 2) Dynamic Linear Regression of last 15 mins should not be pointing steady downwards (phase up/down is ok)

 3) Entry should be timed at the bottom of Momentum Indicators (RSI, AO, MACD, MFI)

 4) VRVP / VWAP should not be below lower BB

 5) Bolinger band should be reasonably steady (Trend / IV steadiness)


 What I learnt Paper Trading:
 ============================

 1) Can still go southways, i.e., once at Rock bottom (MACD, AO, RSI, MFI) can still sink lower

  SAFEGUARD: Set a Stop limit order so you are "hit" from below when buying. This filters out "Falling past rock bottom"

  Also prevents fakeouts from triggering Stop Loss


 